# OI narration — MP3 master-format patch

Built 2026-09-15 · repository-relative paths.

WHY: the first paid run failed on S010 with HTTP 403
  output_format_not_allowed: Output format 'pcm_44100' is only available on the
  Pro tier and above.
Zero clips were generated; fail-fast stopped the other 23 requests.

CHANGE: narration masters are now mp3_44100_128 — 44.1 kHz mono MP3, ~128 kbps.
  Lossy, not lossless. Never transcoded into WAV.

UNCHANGED: voice_id OZxMHsGaBmV5pjMIDIn0 · model eleven_multilingual_v2 ·
  speed 0.72 · stability 0.60 · similarity 0.75 · style 0.0 · speaker boost on ·
  lock 6de1f549a5cca453b174c9d6a5527a723e5e64185ed175ba17d111952b44ecb2
  Output format sits OUTSIDE the voice lock. Narration text, the 24-scene list
  and the 7 held scenes (S130 S130A S140 S180 S190A S210 S220) are untouched.

APPLY: copy this directory's contents onto the repository root, overwriting.
  Then:  python .github/workflows/preflight.py                        -> exit 0
         python .github/workflows/test_generate_narration_workflow.py -> 64 OK
         python elevenlabs/test_generate_scenes.py                    -> 31 OK
  Commit, push, then dispatch with dry_run checked before the paid run.

NOTE: if .gitignore carries 'elevenlabs/audio/*.wav', change it to '*.mp3'.
  No .gitignore is included in this patch.

